13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:51,520 --> 00:01:52,400
Alright,

25
00:01:52,600 --> 00:01:53,830
I'll fight you.

26
00:01:57,880 --> 00:02:01,760
As expected of the one who killed Li Yuanfeng and the Giant Demon Clan Ancestor.

27
00:02:01,800 --> 00:02:03,850
I look forward to learning from you

28
00:02:04,480 --> 00:02:05,790
In this spar,

29
00:02:05,840 --> 00:02:08,150
Brother Ceng doesn't need to hold back due to my status.

30
00:02:13,160 --> 00:02:14,350
A celestial artifact !

31
00:02:16,080 --> 00:02:18,150
Since Brother Ceng is using his trump cards,

32
00:02:18,480 --> 00:02:19,750
then I, Qian Fe...

33
00:02:21,040 --> 00:02:21,790
Devour !

34
00:02:22,160 --> 00:02:24,950
This guy keeps attacking me

35
00:02:24,960 --> 00:02:25,950
and interrupting me !

36
00:02:27,800 --> 00:02:28,550
Cheap tricks !

37
00:02:29,120 --> 00:02:32,320
Ceng Niu truly embodies the philosophy of our Soul Refining Sect.

38
00:02:32,360 --> 00:02:34,270
Either you don't act

39
00:02:34,280 --> 00:02:37,390
or you take the initiative.

40
00:02:38,480 --> 00:02:40,150
Don't celebrate too soon !

41
00:02:41,680 --> 00:02:44,280
Suzaku Awl

42
00:02:43,560 --> 00:02:44,750
The Suzaku Awl...

43
00:02:45,560 --> 00:02:47,550
It's Zhuque Zi's pseudo-celestial artifact.

44
00:02:47,880 --> 00:02:49,150
It's extremely powerful.

45
00:02:49,960 --> 00:02:50,750
Explode !

46
00:02:52,800 --> 00:02:54,010
Suzaku Formation,

47
00:02:54,120 --> 00:02:54,980
gather !

48
00:03:03,400 --> 00:03:05,870
It takes some guts to think of using

49
00:03:06,640 --> 00:03:08,320
self-detonation tactics.

50
00:03:08,560 --> 00:03:10,790
Fortunately, he's only using the sub-flag

51
00:03:10,840 --> 00:03:13,030
so it's not a big deal.

52
00:03:13,760 --> 00:03:16,150
Otherwise, I would have been heartbroken.

53
00:03:17,280 --> 00:03:18,150
Thank you, Senior.

54
00:03:18,600 --> 00:03:19,950
Junior will find opportunities

55
00:03:20,280 --> 00:03:21,990
to replenish the Billion-Soul Flag.

56
00:03:23,160 --> 00:03:24,750
Brother Ceng is really skilled,

57
00:03:25,560 --> 00:03:27,350
I have learned much from this.

58
00:03:27,400 --> 00:03:28,910
You talk too much.

59
00:03:29,440 --> 00:03:30,310
Let's go !

60
00:03:38,760 --> 00:03:39,670
Red Butterfly,

61
00:03:40,360 --> 00:03:41,270
