67
00:04:05,600 --> 00:04:06,550
Lick it clean.

68
00:04:08,960 --> 00:04:11,600
This Billion-Soul Flag is indeed powerful.

69
00:04:11,760 --> 00:04:12,870
Unfortunately,

70
00:04:13,760 --> 00:04:15,910
