71
00:04:24,800 --> 00:04:26,240
Focus on cultivation

72
00:04:26,880 --> 00:04:28,760
and you will reach Soul Transformation.

73
00:04:29,080 --> 00:04:31,070
With this old man guarding you,

74
00:04:31,960 --> 00:04:33,550
