75
00:04:34,000 --> 00:04:36,390
no one will disturb you.

76
00:04:37,040 --> 00:04:37,590
Thank you.

77
00:04:37,760 --> 00:04:38,760
Don't thank me,

78
00:04:39,520 --> 00:04:41,550
just remember our promise.

79
00:04:42,280 --> 00:04:43,800
Senior can rest assured.

80
00:04:49,160 --> 00:04:50,910
Soul Transformation has 3 steps.

81
00:04:51,480 --> 00:04:52,310
The first step

82
00:04:52,640 --> 00:04:53,950
is to cleanse the body.

83
00:04:54,760 --> 00:04:57,150
When the Celestial Realm was intact,

84
00:04:57,240 --> 00:04:59,550
cultivators just needed to enter it

85
00:04:59,600 --> 00:05:02,150
and soak themselves in the Spirit Cleansing Pool.

86
00:05:03,440 --> 00:05:06,550
But now, it requires celestial spiritual energy to cleanse the body

87
00:05:06,560 --> 00:05:08,870
of its mortal roots.

88
00:05:09,080 --> 00:05:12,750
Thus transforming the body completely.

89
00:05:16,680 --> 00:05:17,750
My mortal roots

90
00:05:18,440 --> 00:05:19,470
are gone.

91
00:05:20,680 --> 00:05:22,830
The second step of Soul Transformation

92
00:05:23,160 --> 00:05:24,790
is to refine a celestial body.

93
00:05:25,160 --> 00:05:28,950
By using celestial spiritual energy to rebuild flesh and bones,

94
00:05:29,280 --> 00:05:32,630
it makes the body compatible with celestial spiritual energy.

95
00:05:33,800 --> 00:05:37,230
Although it's excruciatingly painful,

96
00:05:37,760 --> 00:05:41,590
it transforms your body into that of a Celestial.

97
00:05:45,920 --> 00:05:49,280
3 days later

98
00:05:58,480 --> 00:05:59,670
Good.

99
00:06:00,040 --> 00:06:02,630
Now, the final step is

100
00:06:03,000 --> 00:06:04,710
to condense the Origin Soul

101
00:06:05,480 --> 00:06:07,350
and make it corporeal.

102
00:06:07,640 --> 00:06:09,750
Once the Origin Soul fully condenses,

103
00:06:10,200 --> 00:06:12,230
it will merge with the body.

104
00:06:12,560 --> 00:06:13,760
Only then

105
00:06:13,760 --> 00:06:15,750
will Soul Transformation be complete.

106
00:06:17,360 --> 00:06:18,790
What is this smell ?

107
00:06:19,400 --> 00:06:21,590
The scent of your celestial body

108
00:06:21,800 --> 00:06:25,790
