136
00:08:39,160 --> 00:08:40,390
And I, Du Tian,

137
00:08:40,960 --> 00:08:42,830
will not fall behind.

138
00:08:45,880 --> 00:08:48,750
We will reunite soon.

139
00:08:55,440 --> 00:08:58,240
West of the\NSuzaku Continent

140
00:09:01,160 --> 00:09:04,040
Ancestral Spirit Seed

141
00:09:10,440 --> 00:09:11,550
Fifth Ancestor,

142
00:09:11,800 --> 00:09:13,110
