143
00:09:30,160 --> 00:09:34,950
This is the Giant Demon Clan's corpse we got from the Corpse Sect.

144
00:09:35,560 --> 00:09:37,230
With this corpse's help,

145
00:09:37,440 --> 00:09:38,470
