225
00:14:21,560 --> 00:14:22,630
Strike !

226
00:14:53,160 --> 00:14:54,150
No...

227
00:14:55,760 --> 00:14:56,550
No !

228
00:15:11,400 --> 00:15:12,950
Remember this,

229
00:15:13,560 --> 00:15:15,550
I, Zhuque Zi,

230
00:15:15,920 --> 00:15:18,350
