275
00:18:19,960 --> 00:18:21,350
Master...

276
00:18:21,800 --> 00:18:23,270
Senior Brother...

277
00:18:24,760 --> 00:18:25,990
Forgive me.

278
00:18:27,600 --> 00:18:28,670
Du Tian

279
00:18:29,400 --> 00:18:30,750
