282
00:18:36,240 --> 00:18:37,670
Give me a break.

283
00:18:38,280 --> 00:18:39,190
Scram !

284
00:18:45,120 --> 00:18:48,200
Wang Lin's avatar\NEarly stage Soul Transformation

285
00:18:47,640 --> 00:18:48,630
Ceng Niu !?

286
00:18:49,360 --> 00:18:50,550
You're still alive !?

287
00:18:53,160 --> 00:18:53,630
You...

288
00:18:54,360 --> 00:18:55,590
You're not him !

289
00:18:56,280 --> 00:18:58,150
Who the hell are you ?!

290
00:19:02,280 --> 00:21:38,940
When the Celestial Realm was intact, the cultivators ascended to it at Soul Formation. The lowest level in the Celestial Realm was Soul Formation and reaching Soul Transformation was trivial. One really became a Celestial only after reaching Soul Transformation (when one becomes able to use celestial spiritual energy). The method of breakthrough portrayed in the episode is what cultivators found to continue to cultivate after the collapse of the Celestial Realm. However, it's not the only method and it's actually not even the most common one. Most people will do a slow refinement of their body and soul by absorbing celestial spiritual energy over time. This results in a less powerful Soul Transformation but is less risky. Wang Lin doesn't have time for that and takes the risk.

291
00:19:19,880 --> 00:19:23,180
To let go of the consequences of my actions

292
00:19:23,180 --> 00:19:24,900
is to ignore the law of cause and effect

293
00:19:24,940 --> 00:19:26,840
like scattered ink.

294
00:19:27,720 --> 00:19:34,320
As destiny falls

295
00:19:30,560 --> 00:19:34,320
in exchange for this moment of tainted dreams.

296
00:19:34,320 --> 00:19:41,920
It makes the mountains lose their colors,

297
00:19:37,560 --> 00:19:41,920
wither and melt into rivers.

298
00:19:42,360 --> 00:19:49,480
Who can deceive

299
00:19:45,120 --> 00:19:49,480
the law of the heavens ?

300
00:19:49,800 --> 00:19:52,800
Countless generations

301
00:19:51,080 --> 00:19:52,800
have tried before me.

302
00:19:53,090 --> 00:19:56,520
But how could I not catch my dreams

303
00:19:54,920 --> 00:19:56,520
within my warm fingers ?

304
00:19:57,080 --> 00:20:00,600
You're at my side when I'm alone

305
00:20:00,600 --> 00:20:03,920
giving me the strength to fight the will of the heavens.

306
00:20:04,680 --> 00:20:07,880
Fortunately, my mind was open and honest.

307
00:20:08,240 --> 00:20:12,080
I'm sorry we never got to see the fireworks

308
00:20:10,080 --> 00:20:12,080
in the streets.

309
00:20:12,240 --> 00:20:17,040
Can I break the vortex of our destiny ?

310
00:20:13,800 --> 00:20:17,040
Can I break the rules ?

311
00:20:17,050 --> 00:20:19,760
To run towards you !

312
00:20:19,800 --> 00:20:23,080
I will fight the law of the heavens and the law of cause and effect

313
00:20:23,080 --> 00:20:27,720
to cut down this tribulation with my own hands

314
00:20:27,720 --> 00:20:31,120
and break through the reincarnation cycle.

315
00:20:31,160 --> 00:20:35,800
All of that for the stars in your eyes.

316
00:20:36,250 --> 00:20:41,480
I wish to bend this dream for the fire in my heart.

317
00:20:41,600 --> 00:20:45,400
If your soul is willing to wander,

318
00:20:45,400 --> 00:20:50,040
can I still take your hands

319
00:20:47,080 --> 00:20:50,040
and hold them tight ?

320
00:20:50,200 --> 00:20:53,120
I will defy the heavens and prevent the stars from falling.

321
00:20:53,120 --> 00:20:58,000
I will overthrow the Immortals and the Demons in my heart.

322
00:20:58,010 --> 00:21:01,280
I dream of destroying

323
00:21:01,440 --> 00:21:06,000
the shackles of our fate.

324
00:21:06,000 --> 00:21:09,960
You're the only one that can ignore the law of cause and effect.

325
00:21:09,960 --> 00:21:12,760
You're the hardest to let go of.

326
00:21:12,840 --> 00:21:16,640
I want to be with you again

327
00:21:16,720 --> 00:21:20,000
so I can look in your eyes.

328
00:21:20,280 --> 00:21:25,240
Even for a moment, it's worth it.
